menu "embedded-h3-location"

    config EMBEDDED_H3_LOCATION_ALLOC_PREFIX
        string "Prefix for the allocator H3 calls"
        default ""
        help
            H3 allocates only inside cells_to_multipolygon, through H3_MEMORY
            in the vendored H3 alloc.h. Empty means plain malloc, calloc,
            realloc and free. A prefix such as my_h3_ makes H3 call
            my_h3_malloc, my_h3_calloc, my_h3_realloc and my_h3_free instead.
            The application defines all four with C linkage and libc
            semantics, for example over heap_caps_malloc to choose PSRAM. The
            prefix must start with a letter or underscore and hold only
            letters, digits and underscores.

endmenu
